# Follower entry.  The raw NativeCommand kind must be STREAM_FIRST or
# STREAM_NEXT; settle_at_end is the explicit final-block flag.  The service
# entry, not a hidden request field, selects bounded-follower planning.
robot_api_msgs/NativeCommand request
---
bool accepted
string reason
bool has_execution
robot_api_msgs/NativeExecution execution
bool has_chunk
robot_api_msgs/NativeChunkStatus chunk
bool has_reference
robot_api_msgs/FollowerReference reference
